            Template {
                segments,
                pos: start_pos,
                bare_literal,
                empty_quoted,
                quoted: !is_single_bare_literal,
            },
            display,
        ))
    }

    fn parse_command_expansion(&mut self) -> Option<(TemplateSegment, String)> {
